
### Hent alle medlemmer
GET http://localhost:5009/api/members

### Hent alt tøj
GET http://localhost:5009/api/clothing

### Hent tøj fra et bestemt medlem
GET http://localhost:5009/api/clothing/member/1


### Test ugyldig ejer
POST http://localhost:5009/api/clothing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "ownerId": 99999,
  "type": "Dress",
  "size": "M",
  "color": "Black",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "imgLink": "https://example.com/dress.jpg"
}
